{"license":"SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later","source":{"run":"m20-search-p15","game":"llm-m20-search-p15-002","frames":"frames/llm-m20-search-p15-002.jsonl seq 984, 987, 1004, 1021, 1038 (notices), 1041 (its combat only)","decisions":"decisions.jsonl lines 268-276"},"replies":["The unblocked attackers deal exactly 8, which is lethal at 8 life, so I have to block. Mountains are tapped, so I can't cast Spiteful Prankster. Amethyst Dragon blocks Writhing Chrysalis, which kills it and keeps the Dragon alive, since Chrysalis has no deathtouch. The Eldrazi Spawn chump-blocks Vampire Nighthawk, so its deathtouch doesn't hit the Dragon. That stops 4 damage and leaves me at 4 life.\n\nPLAN: Block Writhing Chrysalis with Amethyst Dragon and Vampire Nighthawk with the Eldrazi Spawn Token, taking 4 damage.\nSTEPS:\n1. block Writhing Chrysalis with Amethyst Dragon\n2. block Vampire Nighthawk with Eldrazi Spawn Token\nEND","The Eldrazi Spawn can't block Vampire Nighthawk because Nighthawk has flying and the Spawn has no reach. That is why the engine refused it. The attack is exactly lethal at 8 damage, so I need to block enough to survive. The Spawn can chump Writhing Chrysalis (2 power), and Amethyst Dragon can block Mulldrifter and kill it without taking deathtouch damage. That leaves me at 3 life and keeps the Dragon.\n\nPLAN: Spawn chump-blocks Writhing Chrysalis and Amethyst Dragon blocks Mulldrifter, which cuts the 8 damage to 5 and keeps the Dragon alive.\nSTEPS:\n1. block Writhing Chrysalis with Eldrazi Spawn Token\n2. block Mulldrifter with Amethyst Dragon\nEND","The engine refused the Dragon as a blocker, but the attackers deal exactly 8, which is my life total, so I need every block I can get. I'll resend the original two blocks in the opposite order in case the order caused the refusal.\n\nPLAN: Block Mulldrifter with Amethyst Dragon and Writhing Chrysalis with the Eldrazi Spawn Token to stay above lethal.\nSTEPS:\n1. block Mulldrifter with Amethyst Dragon\n2. block Writhing Chrysalis with Eldrazi Spawn Token\nEND"],"attempts":[[{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":28},{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":3},{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":89},{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":138},{"type":"act","action":"buttonOk"}],[{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":28},{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":138},{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":75},{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":3},{"type":"act","action":"buttonOk"}],[{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":28},{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":138},{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":75},{"type":"act","action":"clickCard","cardId":3},{"type":"act","action":"buttonOk"}]],"refusals":["the engine refused it: \"Not selectable: Eldrazi Spawn Token cannot be selected now\"","the engine refused it: \"Not selectable: Amethyst Dragon cannot be selected now\"","the engine refused it: \"Not selectable: Amethyst Dragon cannot be selected now\""],"frames":[{"seq":984,"type":"state","body":{"gameId":"llm-m20-search-p15-002","turn":23,"round":12,"phase":"COMBAT_DECLARE_BLOCKERS","activePlayer":1,"priority":0,"gameOver":null,"players":[{"id":0,"name":"Human","isAi":false,"life":8,"poison":0,"counters":{},"manaPool":{"W":0,"U":0,"B":0,"R":0,"G":0,"C":0},"phaseStops":{"own":["MAIN1","MAIN2"],"opp":["COMBAT_DECLARE_BLOCKERS"]},"zones":{"hand":{"count":1,"cards":[{"id":29,"name":"Spiteful Prankster","setCode":"J22","manaCost":"{2}{R}","types":"Creature - Devil","power":"3","toughness":"2","loyalty":null,"keywords":[],"damage":0,"counters":{},"tapped":false,"sick":false,"attacking":false,"blocking":false,"faceDown":false,"token":false,"alt":null,"attachedToId":null,"attachmentIds":[],"controller":0,"owner":0,"zone":"hand","abilities":[]}]},"battlefield":{"count":12,"cards":[{"id":24,"name":"Island","setCode":"TRK","manaCost":null,"types":"Basic Land - Island","power":null,"toughness":null,"loyalty":null,"ke